          "_name": "header11",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header11\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background7.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.manjubadrops.com/edcaps-dtc#aff=ajaykumar801505\"><img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/dzglzo2034703.webp\" alt=\"Manjuba Caps\"></a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper text-center\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                        <b>Make Fun Creating</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Manjuba Caps is a dietary supplement formulated specifically around men's wellness and vitality. It is marketed toward adult men who want nutritional support for energy, stamina, confidence, circulation, and sexual wellness. Instead of being presented as a prescription medication, Manjuba Caps is positioned as a botanical-based supplement that can be added to an everyday wellness routine. The formula contains several plant-based ingredients that have traditionally been used in men's health products. This makes it convenient for someone who prefers taking a capsule rather than combining several separate supplements. The product is intended to support normal body functions rather than provide an instant or guaranteed result.<br><br>For many men, maintaining energy and physical confidence becomes more important with age. Busy schedules, poor sleep, stress, limited physical activity, and an unbalanced diet can all affect how a person feels during the day. Manjuba Caps is designed to provide nutritional support alongside a healthy lifestyle. Its blend includes ingredients commonly associated with male vitality and circulation support. The idea is simple: give the body selected botanical compounds as part of a consistent daily routine while continuing to focus on healthy habits. It should be viewed as a wellness supplement rather than a treatment for erectile dysfunction, low testosterone, prostate disease, or any other medical condition.<br><br>Another important part of understanding Manjuba Caps is knowing that supplements work differently from person to person. Some people may notice changes in energy or general well-being, while others may not experience the same effects. Factors such as age, diet, exercise, sleep, existing health conditions, medications, and individual body chemistry can influence results. Because of this, it is better to approach Manjuba Caps with realistic expectations. Consistent use according to the product directions, combined with good lifestyle choices, is a more sensible approach than expecting an immediate transformation after one serving.<br><br>Manjuba Caps also appeals to men who prefer formulas containing familiar botanical ingredients. The product's ingredient profile includes herbs such as Tribulus Terrestris, Fenugreek Seed, Saw Palmetto, and Epimedium, along with ingredients intended to complement the overall formula. Black Pepper Extract is included as a supporting ingredient commonly used in supplement formulations to help with the utilization of botanical compounds. Each ingredient has its own traditional role, but the complete formula is intended to provide broader male wellness support rather than focusing on just one area.<br><br>Overall, Manjuba Caps can be considered a convenient addition to a daily men's wellness routine. It is not designed to replace a nutritious diet, physical activity, quality sleep, or medical advice. Men who are already taking prescription medicines or who have an existing medical condition should speak with a healthcare professional before starting a new supplement. The most practical way to use a product like Manjuba Caps is to follow the label directions consistently and give the body enough time to respond while maintaining healthy everyday habits.<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get Started</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
