          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>How GlucoFlush Works?\n</b><div><b><br></b></div></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><div>Manjuba Caps is designed to support several areas associated with male wellness rather than focusing on one single function. Its botanical ingredients are selected for their traditional and researched roles in areas such as vitality, circulation, stamina, and overall men's health. Healthy circulation is especially important for physical performance because blood flow naturally plays a role in many body functions. Rather than promising an immediate effect, the product is intended to provide nutritional support when used consistently as part of a broader wellness routine. Individual results can vary, so the formula should be viewed as supportive rather than as a guaranteed solution.</div><div><br></div><div>One part of the formula focuses on ingredients traditionally associated with male vitality and physical performance. Tribulus Terrestris and Fenugreek Seed Extract are commonly found in men's wellness supplements because of their association with libido, stamina, and healthy hormonal function. This does not mean that the ingredients will automatically increase testosterone or resolve a hormone-related medical problem. Instead, they are included as part of a nutritional approach to supporting normal male wellness. Healthy eating, exercise, sufficient sleep, and stress control remain important because no supplement can compensate for consistently unhealthy lifestyle habits.</div><div><br></div><div>Circulation is another area connected with the way Manjuba Caps is positioned. Healthy blood flow is naturally important for physical activity and sexual function. Ingredients such as Epimedium and other botanicals are traditionally used in male vitality formulas for this reason. Saw Palmetto is also included in the formula and is commonly associated with men's prostate and urinary wellness products. The combination is intended to provide broader support rather than relying on a single ingredient. However, supplement ingredients should not be assumed to treat circulation disorders or sexual health conditions.</div><div><br></div><div>The formula also contains Black Pepper Extract, which is commonly included in supplement formulas to complement the absorption and utilization of certain botanical compounds. Along with the other ingredients, it helps make the formulation more comprehensive. The product also includes Alpha Lipoic Acid and Milk Thistle, ingredients frequently used in nutritional and antioxidant-focused supplements. Together, these components are intended to complement the broader wellness approach of Manjuba Caps. The goal is not to create a sudden stimulant-like sensation but to provide nutritional support that fits into a consistent daily routine.</div><div><br></div><div>Ultimately, the way Manjuba Caps works should be understood as nutritional support rather than medical treatment. The body needs adequate nutrition, movement, sleep, hydration, and stress management to function well, and supplements can only play a supporting role. Following the recommended serving and maintaining consistency may provide a better experience than taking capsules irregularly. If a person has persistent problems with energy, sexual performance, urination, or other health concerns, speaking with a qualified healthcare professional is important instead of relying only on a dietary supplement.</div><div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div></div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
