          "_name": "header3",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header3\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n\n        <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <select title=\"Align\" name=\"contentAlign\">\n            <option value>Left</option>\n            <option value=\"justify-content-center\" selected>Center</option>\n            <option value=\"justify-content-end\">Right</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background11.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.2\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"align-center\" mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row {{contentAlign}}\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Building a website</b></h1>\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showSubitle\"></h2>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">For fast prototyping and small customers' projects.</p>\n                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a class=\"btn btn-success\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Free Download!</a></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "header3-1o",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "tB85MvgqdZ",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "list-style": "none",
                "padding-left": "2.5rem",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "position": "relative",
                  "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "content": "\"\"",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background-color": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "& when (@countersType = \"circle\")": {
                        "background": "none",
                        "border": "1px solid @iconColor",
                        "color": "@iconColor"
                      },
                      "& when (@countersType = \"square\")": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      },
                      "& when (@mark)": {
                        "content": "\"✓\""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "& when not (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-1.6rem",
                      "content": "\"\\2022\"",
                      "color": "@iconColor",
                      "font-weight": "bold",
                      "font-size": "2rem",
                      "width": "1.6rem",
                      "line-height": "1.2"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "content8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" checked condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>Сircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#18356a\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Shape your future web project with the Mobirise app.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Supports Daily Male Vitality: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">One of the main reasons men may consider Manjuba Caps is its focus on overall male vitality. Feeling energetic and physically capable can influence work, exercise, relationships, and everyday confidence. The formula combines several botanical ingredients traditionally used in men's wellness products, creating a broader nutritional approach instead of relying on one ingredient. Tribulus Terrestris and Fenugreek Seed are particularly associated with male vitality and stamina support. While results are different for everyone, taking a supplement consistently alongside a healthy diet and active lifestyle may help support normal energy and wellness. Manjuba Caps is not intended to treat fatigue or any medical condition, but it can be used as part of a balanced approach to maintaining men's everyday vitality.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Promotes Healthy Stamina And Endurance:</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp;Stamina is important for men who want to stay active and feel capable throughout the day. Manjuba Caps contains botanical ingredients commonly used in supplements designed around physical endurance and male performance. Fenugreek and Tribulus are included as part of this approach, while other ingredients complement the formula. Good stamina does not come from a capsule alone. Regular exercise, adequate protein and nutrients, hydration, and quality sleep are all essential. Manjuba Caps can therefore be viewed as an additional nutritional tool rather than a replacement for healthy habits. Individual responses can vary, but consistent use alongside a healthy routine may help support the feeling of sustained physical vitality.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Supports Healthy Circulation:</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp;Healthy circulation is important for many aspects of physical performance and general wellness. Manjuba Caps includes botanical ingredients selected for their traditional use in men's vitality formulas, including Epimedium and other plant extracts. Supporting normal circulation can be particularly relevant to men interested in physical performance and sexual wellness. However, the product should not be considered a treatment for high blood pressure, vascular disease, or other circulation disorders. Lifestyle factors such as regular walking, cardiovascular exercise, maintaining a healthy weight, avoiding tobacco, and eating a balanced diet remain important. Manjuba Caps is best viewed as a supplement that complements those habits rather than replacing them.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Supports Men's Sexual Wellness:</b>&nbsp;Sexual wellness involves much more than one physical function. Energy, mood, confidence, circulation, sleep, and general health can all influence how a person feels. Manjuba Caps is formulated with several botanical ingredients commonly used in male vitality products, including Tribulus Terrestris, Fenugreek Seed, and Epimedium. These ingredients are included to provide nutritional support for men's overall sexual wellness. Individual results are never guaranteed, and the supplement should not be promoted as a cure for erectile dysfunction or other sexual health disorders. Men experiencing persistent sexual difficulties should consider speaking with a healthcare professional because those symptoms can sometimes have an underlying medical cause.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Supports Prostate And Men's Wellness:</b>&nbsp;Saw Palmetto is one of the recognizable ingredients in the Manjuba Caps formula and is traditionally associated with men's prostate and urinary wellness. This makes it relevant to men who want to include prostate-focused nutritional support in their daily routine. A healthy lifestyle remains important for prostate wellness, including regular physical activity, a balanced diet, adequate hydration, and routine medical checkups when appropriate. Manjuba Caps should not be viewed as a treatment for an enlarged prostate, urinary disease, or any other medical condition. Instead, it can be considered one part of a broader approach to maintaining men's health as they get older.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Helps Support Everyday Confidence:</b>&nbsp;Confidence can be affected by how energetic, active, and comfortable a person feels in everyday life. Manjuba Caps is designed around several aspects of male wellness, including vitality, stamina, circulation, and sexual wellness. Supporting these areas through healthy habits may help a man feel more prepared for daily activities and personal relationships. However, confidence is not something a supplement can guarantee. Sleep, exercise, stress management, communication, and overall health all contribute significantly. Manjuba Caps can simply be included as one supportive part of a personal wellness routine for men who want to take a more consistent approach to their health.</span></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
